After some more work on mono support for Linux/Alpha I was able to build 
all profile libraries and packaged
mono to rpms. The packages for AC2 are available at:
ftp://alphalinux.rdsor.ro/pub/Linux/Distributions/AlphaLinux/core/2.0/test/
Look for *novell* packages. The software itself is declared as beta, but 
I guess it could be used to play with C#.
In my current working version it does work with gtk wrappers and draws 
windows and widgets inside them.

There is still work ahead. :)

